{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nelumbra</strong> is a 2.5D roguelite time-survival game. You embody the Light Bearer, a savior trying to survive throughout timeloops to discover about its own fate. Survive relentless celestial hordes and bosses, discover new characters, enhance your powers and shape your destiny with every loop. Will you break free or become part of the cycle forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AUTO ATTACKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace and master your character's\u00a0innate auto-attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapons between loops to match your preferred playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281380/extras/AutoAttacks_v2.gif?t=1744716841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DASHES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash frenetic dashes to weave through hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance their power and effects as you progress, creating dynamic synergies with your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281380/extras/Dashes_v2.gif?t=1744716841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Runs:</strong> Complete intense and rewarding runs in under 15 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Variety:</strong> Experiment with scaling builds using weapons, dashes, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Characters:</strong> Unlock and discover characters, each with their own  characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Items:</strong> Choose between multiple celestial artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Handcrafted Visuals: and Audio:</strong> Dive into an immersive 2.5D celestial world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accessibility Options:</strong> Tailor your own experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281380?t=1744716841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744716841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281380/c9b7d5b03142f16d2042894af94a2f36fc0f2ee6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744716841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281380/c9b7d5b03142f16d2042894af94a2f36fc0f2ee6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744716841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3544940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nelumbra</strong> is a 2.5D roguelite time-survival game. You embody the Light Bearer, a savior trying to survive throughout timeloops to discover about its own fate. Survive relentless celestial hordes and bosses, discover new characters, enhance your powers and shape your destiny with every loop. Will you break free or become part of the cycle forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AUTO ATTACKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace and master your character's\u00a0innate auto-attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapons betwee